  "body": "CT reference: NA1610/75\r\n\r\nTo be sold by way of Tender 4.00pm, Tuesday 27th October, 4 Bute Road, Browns Bay, Auckland\r\n\r\n• Three standalone brand-new houses located on a 2618sqm (more or less) site\r\n\r\n• Channel View Road is one of the top streets in Campbells Bay, North Shore\r\n\r\n• CCC for all have been issued\r\n\r\n• Lot 1: Total floors area including deck 278.8sqm (more or less) - 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 2 living areas and double garage\r\n• Lot 2: Total floors area including decks 411.7sqm (more or less) - 4 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, 2 living areas and double garage\r\n• Lot 3: Total floors area including deck 300.4sqm (more or less) - 5 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, 3 living areas and double garage\r\n\r\n• Under Title Plan: Land area- Lot 1 is 1018sqm (more or less); Lot 2 is 846sqm (more or less); Lot 3 is 752sqm (more or less)\r\n\r\n• S224c Completion Certificate has been issued in Landonline\r\n• Close to Centennial Park, Campbells Bay Tennis Club, playgrounds, childcare centres, Kennedy Park, Campbells Bay Beach and Castor Bay Beach \r\n\r\n• Located in top school zones: Campbells Bay Primary, Mairangi Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys High School and Westlake Girls High School\r\n\r\n• Approximately a 5-minute drive to Milford Shopping Centre and Mairangi Bay Village\r\n\r\n• Easy proximity to motorway, public transport and North Shore Hospital\r\n\r\nThis is a mortgagee sale - please ensure you do your own due diligence and seek legal advice before the Tender closing date. \r\n\r\nPlease contact me if you require any further information\r\nSam Yeung 021 39 22 88\r\n(English/ Mandarin/ Cantonese)",
